---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Case Studies | The One Group" description="Real results from real businesses. See how South Florida companies are using AI automation to grow.">
  
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 via-white to-brand-50/30 dark:from-gray-950 dark:via-gray-950 dark:to-brand-950/20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center">
      <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Case Studies</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-bold mt-4 mb-4">Real Results, Real Businesses</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        See how South Florida companies are using AI automation to save time and grow revenue.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Case Study 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-8 lg:p-10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-200">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-50 dark:bg-brand-900/30">Legal</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/30">5x More Meetings</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-3">Coastal Law Partners</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
          A boutique law firm in West Palm Beach was relying on manual lead research and cold calling. 
          We built an AI agent system that researches prospects, drafts personalized outreach, and books meetings automatically.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">5x</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">More qualified meetings</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">25/mo</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Qualified meetings</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">40h</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Saved per month</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm italic text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 border-l-2 border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-800 pl-4">
          "The AI agent system handles our lead research and initial outreach. We went from 5 calls a week to 25 qualified meetings a month. Game changer."
          <span class="block not-italic mt-2 font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">— Maria Santos, Owner</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Case Study 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-8 lg:p-10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-200">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-50 dark:bg-brand-900/30">Healthcare</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/30">40h/mo Saved</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-3">West Palm Family Medicine</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
          A growing medical practice was drowning in administrative work — appointment reminders, intake forms, 
          and follow-up calls. We automated the entire patient communication workflow.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">40h</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Saved per month</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">100%</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Appointment reminders automated</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">30%</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Fewer no-shows</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm italic text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 border-l-2 border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-800 pl-4">
          "We were skeptical about AI in healthcare admin. The One Group automated our appointment reminders, intake forms, and follow-ups. Saved us 40 hours a month."
          <span class="block not-italic mt-2 font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">— James Chen, CEO</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Case Study 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-8 lg:p-10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-200">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-50 dark:bg-brand-900/30">HVAC</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-900/30">ROI in Week 1</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-3">Premier HVAC Services</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl">
          Missed calls were costing this HVAC company over $2,000 per month in lost business. 
          We implemented an AI lead response system that catches every call, qualifies leads, and books appointments.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">$2k/mo</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Recovered revenue</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">100%</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">Calls answered</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Week 1</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1">ROI achieved</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm italic text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 border-l-2 border-brand-200 dark:border-brand-800 pl-4">
          "Missed calls were costing us $2,000+ a month. The AI lead response system catches every call, qualifies them, and books appointments. ROI in week one."
          <span class="block not-italic mt-2 font-medium text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">— David Rodriguez, Operations Director</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="text-center pt-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-6">Your Business Could Be Next</h2>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          Book Your Free Audit
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
